*.db
*.sqlite
*.log

# Firebase
**/.firebase/
**/firebase-debug.log

# Temp files
*.tmp
*.temp
.cache/

# API Keys and Secrets
**/*-secrets.*
**/secrets.*
**/*.secret
.credentials/

# Markdown documentation files
*.md
# Keep important documentation
!README.md
!LICENSE.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CHANGELOG.md

# Admin setup and configuration documentation
**/ADMIN-*.md
**/EXECUTE-THIS-*.sql
**/setup-admin-*.ps1
**/insert-admin-*.sql
**/verify-admin-*.sql
**/*-SETUP*.md
**/*-GUIDE*.md
**/*-FIX*.md

# SQL Files - Database scripts and schemas
*.sql
**/*.sql
# Keep template/migration SQL files if needed
!**/migrations/*.sql
!**/schema/*.sql

# Firebase Configuration Files (contain API keys)
**/firebase.js
!**/firebase.js.template

# Environment Files (contain API keys and secrets)
.env*
!.env.template
!.env.example

# API Keys and Credentials
**/apiKeys.js
**/credentials.json
**/serviceAccountKey.json
**/*-credentials.*
**/*-apikey.*
**/*-key.json

# Password and Secret Files
**/passwords.txt
**/secrets.txt
**/.secrets/
**/*password*
!**/package.json
!**/package-lock.json

# Spring Boot Application Properties (may contain DB passwords)
**/application.properties
**/application.yml
!**/application.properties.template
!**/application.yml.template

# Test Credentials (Razorpay, etc.)
**/*-test-credentials.*
**/*-credentials.*

